error[SC0407]: this may pass a pointer to an allocation that was freed
    ╭─[ a_call_unsequenced_with_a_free_is_not_proved_to_be_handed_it.c:10:27 ]
    │
  6 │     int *a = malloc(4);
    │              ────┬────  
    │                  ╰────── allocated here
    │ 
 10 │     return (free(a), 0) + use(a);
    │             ───┬───       ───┬──  
    │                ╰────────────────── freed here
    │                              │    
    │                              ╰──── passed here, perhaps after the free
